    "detail": {
      "id": 1320201,
      "name": "[Dexterity] Talisman of Five Realms",
      "desc": "When triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color>, all squad members <color=#2BAD00>gain 1 Dexterity Count</color>, stacking up to 3 times. With 3 <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Count</color>, consume all stacks to <color=#2BAD00>enter Dexterity State</color>, lasting 9s. While in <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity State</color>, all squad members' <color=#2BAD00>ATK is increased by 60%</color>. When an attack hits an enemy, it inflicts <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color> on the target. <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color> is calculated when exiting <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity State</color>, dealing <color=#2BAD00>additional DMG equal to 10% of DMG accumulated</color> during <color=#FFFFFF>Dexterity Curse</color> to enemies.",
